  "description": "JOYSTAR Cervine Kids' Bike - 10\" to 16\"\nLet your little one roam with confidence on the JOYSTAR Cervine Kids' Bike. Featuring a sleek, minimalist frame and a playful front basket, this bike is designed to make the first riding experience safe, simple, and full of joy.\n\nModern elegance for tiny adventurers: The JOYSTAR Cervine.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Simplicity is safety. The Cervine features a streamlined coaster brake and a durable frame to help toddlers master balance without distraction.\"\nIntuitive Safety Design\nThe JOYSTAR Cervine is crafted with a high-carbon steel frame, providing a sturdy yet manageable base for young riders. Focusing on intuitive control, every size comes equipped with a rear coaster brake—just pedal backward to stop. This eliminates the complexity of hand levers for beginners and ensures reliable stopping power every time.\n\nFully enclosed chain guard and intuitive coaster brake for worry-free riding.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nTailored Tire Options: 10\" and 12\" models feature maintenance-free EVA foam tires, while 14\" and 16\" models utilize pneumatic rubber tires for superior outdoor traction.\n\nAdjustable Components: Quick-release seat post and adjustable handlebars allow the bike to grow as your child does.\n\nSafety First: A full-wrap chain guard keeps fingers and shoelaces away from the drivetrain.\n\nPlayful Accessories: Features a stylish front woven basket for favorite toys and a classic bell to announce their arrival.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nGet riding in no time. The JOYSTAR Cervine arrives 85% pre-assembled. We provide the tools and a straightforward guide so you can have the handlebars, seat, and pedals installed in about 20 minutes.\n\nQuick Setup: From box to sidewalk in less than 20 minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Backyard\n\nWalk through all the details of Cervine Kids' Bike.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR is committed to quality. We offer a comprehensive warranty to ensure your child enjoys their ride for years to come:\n\nLifetime Frame Warranty: Our steel frames are protected against manufacturing defects for the life of the original owner.\n\n2-Year Component Warranty: Non-wear parts like forks and handlebars are covered for 24 months.",
